<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/creation-phase> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The part of the learning engineering process in which a team creates a response to a learning challenge by designing the solution, planning and instrumenting the needed data, and iterating the design with learners and stakeholders." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/creation-phase/versions/1> .
