<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/creation-phase> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Treating instrumentation and iteration as part of creation helps ensure that a solution is designed to generate useful evidence from the start." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/creation-phase/versions/1> .
